{"id":"architecture","title":"2. System Architecture","phase":null,"phaseName":null,"category":"Documentation","subcategory":"architecture","language":"markdown","description":"","sections":[],"content":"<h2>Main Architecture</h2><div class=\"docs-diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1100 680\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\"> <defs> <linearGradient id=\"grad-client\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#eff6ff\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#dbeafe\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"grad-container\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#f0fdf4\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#dcfce7\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"grad-node\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#f0f9ff\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#e0f2fe\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"grad-python\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#ecfdf5\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#d1fae5\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"grad-services\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#fff7ed\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#ffedd5\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"grad-external\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#fdf2f8\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#fce7f3\" /> </linearGradient> <filter id=\"shadow\" x=\"-8%\" y=\"-8%\" width=\"116%\" height=\"116%\"> <feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"4\" stdDeviation=\"6\" flood-color=\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08)\" /> </filter> <marker id=\"arr-blue\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#2563eb\" /> </marker> <marker id=\"arr-amber\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#d97706\" /> </marker> <marker id=\"arr-purple\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#9333ea\" /> </marker> <marker id=\"arr-pink\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#db2777\" /> </marker> <marker id=\"arr-green\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#16a34a\" /> </marker> <style> .node-card { rx: 12; ry: 12; stroke-width: 1.5; filter: url(#shadow); } .txt-hdr { font-family: Ubuntu, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: #0f172a; } .txt-lbl { font-family: Ubuntu, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; fill: #334155; } .txt-sub { font-family: 'SF Mono', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 10px; fill: #64748b; } .flow-path { stroke-dasharray: 6,4; animation: dash 1.6s linear infinite; } @keyframes dash { to { stroke-dashoffset: -20; } } .chip { rx: 4; ry: 4; fill: #ffffff; stroke-width: 1; } .chip-txt { font-family: Ubuntu, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; } </style> </defs> <!-- Background --> <rect width=\"1100\" height=\"680\" fill=\"#ffffff\" rx=\"16\" /> <!-- Title --> <text x=\"550\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">bookshop-multi-buildpack — System Architecture</text> <text x=\"550\" y=\"56\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#64748b\">SAP BTP Cloud Foundry • Multi-Buildpack • Node.js CAP + Persistent Python Worker Bridge</text> <!-- Component Cards --> <!-- 1. Client Layer --> <g transform=\"translate(30, 85)\"> <rect width=\"170\" height=\"420\" fill=\"url(#grad-client)\" stroke=\"#bfdbfe\" class=\"node-card\" /> <text x=\"85\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\">Client Layer</text> <text x=\"85\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-lbl\">Browsers / Fiori UI</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"70\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" /> <text x=\"85\" y=\"87\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">OData V4 (/browse)</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"110\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" /> <text x=\"85\" y=\"127\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">AI SSE (/ai/ask)</text> <text x=\"85\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-lbl\">Clients:</text> <text x=\"85\" y=\"195\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">• Fiori Elements</text> <text x=\"85\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">• Mobile / Web App</text> <text x=\"85\" y=\"235\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">• REST API Clients</text> </g> <!-- 2. Application Container (Droplet) --> <g transform=\"translate(230, 85)\"> <rect width=\"520\" height=\"420\" fill=\"url(#grad-container)\" stroke=\"#86efac\" class=\"node-card\" /> <text x=\"260\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\">SAP BTP Container (Cloud Foundry Droplet)</text> <text x=\"260\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">Co-located Node.js &amp; Python Processes</text> <!-- 2a. Node.js CAP Server --> <rect x=\"20\" y=\"65\" width=\"220\" height=\"330\" fill=\"url(#grad-node)\" stroke=\"#7dd3fc\" class=\"node-card\" /> <text x=\"130\" y=\"90\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\">Node.js CAP Server</text> <text x=\"130\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-lbl\">@sap/cds v10 + Express</text> <rect x=\"30\" y=\"125\" width=\"160\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#bae6fd\" /> <text x=\"110\" y=\"141\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">srv/server.js ($PORT)</text> <rect x=\"30\" y=\"160\" width=\"160\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#bae6fd\" /> <text x=\"110\" y=\"176\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">srv/cat-service.js</text> <rect x=\"30\" y=\"195\" width=\"160\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#bae6fd\" /> <text x=\"110\" y=\"211\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">srv/ai-service.js</text> <rect x=\"30\" y=\"230\" width=\"160\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#bae6fd\" /> <text x=\"110\" y=\"246\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">srv/python.js (Bridge)</text> <!-- 2b. Python Worker Process --> <rect x=\"280\" y=\"65\" width=\"220\" height=\"330\" fill=\"url(#grad-python)\" stroke=\"#6ee7b7\" class=\"node-card\" /> <text x=\"390\" y=\"90\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\">Python Worker</text> <text x=\"390\" y=\"110\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-lbl\">Persistent Process</text> <rect x=\"295\" y=\"125\" width=\"190\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#a7f3d0\" /> <text x=\"390\" y=\"141\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">python/functions.py --worker</text> <rect x=\"295\" y=\"160\" width=\"190\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#a7f3d0\" /> <text x=\"390\" y=\"176\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">apply_discount() Math</text> <rect x=\"295\" y=\"195\" width=\"190\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#a7f3d0\" /> <text x=\"390\" y=\"211\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">ask_ai() Token Streamer</text> <rect x=\"295\" y=\"230\" width=\"190\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#a7f3d0\" /> <text x=\"390\" y=\"246\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">JSON-RPC Loop (stdin/out)</text> </g> <!-- 3. BTP Services Layer --> <g transform=\"translate(780, 85)\"> <rect width=\"290\" height=\"420\" fill=\"url(#grad-services)\" stroke=\"#fed7aa\" class=\"node-card\" /> <text x=\"145\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\">SAP BTP &amp; External Services</text> <text x=\"145\" y=\"54\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-lbl\">Managed Backends</text> <rect x=\"20\" y=\"70\" width=\"250\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#fdba74\" /> <text x=\"145\" y=\"92\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#c2410c\">XSUAA Authentication</text> <text x=\"145\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">OAuth2 / JWT Token Validation</text> <rect x=\"20\" y=\"135\" width=\"250\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#fdba74\" /> <text x=\"145\" y=\"157\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#c2410c\">BTP Destination Service</text> <text x=\"145\" y=\"173\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">Resolves LLM Target &amp; API Key</text> <rect x=\"20\" y=\"200\" width=\"250\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#fdba74\" /> <text x=\"145\" y=\"222\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#c2410c\">HANA Cloud / SQLite DB</text> <text x=\"145\" y=\"238\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">Book &amp; Author Catalog Data</text> <rect x=\"20\" y=\"265\" width=\"250\" height=\"120\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"url(#grad-external)\" stroke=\"#f472b6\" /> <text x=\"145\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#be185d\">NVIDIA AI Core</text> <text x=\"145\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-lbl\">Llama 3.3 70B Instruct</text> <text x=\"145\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct</text> <text x=\"145\" y=\"350\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">OpenAI-Compatible Chat API</text> </g> <!-- Explicit Non-Overlapping Connectors (Top Layer) --> <!-- 1. Client -> Node.js CAP Server (HTTPS / OData / SSE) --> <path d=\"M 200,180 L 250,180\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"flow-path\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-blue)\" /> <rect x=\"206\" y=\"169\" width=\"38\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" class=\"chip\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"225\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"chip-txt\" fill=\"#2563eb\">HTTP</text> <!-- 2. Node.js -> Python Worker (stdin / stdout JSON-RPC Bridge) --> <path d=\"M 470,240 L 510,240\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"flow-path\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-green)\" /> <rect x=\"472\" y=\"229\" width=\"36\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" class=\"chip\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"490\" y=\"244\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"chip-txt\" fill=\"#16a34a\">IPC</text> <!-- 3. Node.js -> HANA Cloud DB (Bypassing Python completely: drops down from Node card at Y=430, runs below container, goes up to HANA DB at X=920, Y=335) --> <path d=\"M 360,435 L 360,470 L 920,470 L 920,335\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" stroke-dasharray=\"6,4\" class=\"flow-path\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-amber)\" /> <rect x=\"615\" y=\"457\" width=\"50\" height=\"24\" rx=\"4\" class=\"chip\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"640\" y=\"473\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"chip-txt\" fill=\"#d97706\">SQL DB</text> <!-- 4. Python Worker -> NVIDIA AI Core (Outbound Chat API) --> <path d=\"M 730,370 L 800,370\" stroke=\"#db2777\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"flow-path\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-pink)\" /> <rect x=\"744\" y=\"359\" width=\"42\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" class=\"chip\" stroke=\"#db2777\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" /> <text x=\"765\" y=\"374\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"chip-txt\" fill=\"#db2777\">REST</text> <!-- Table Container (Bottom) --> <g transform=\"translate(30, 505)\"> <rect width=\"1040\" height=\"155\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" rx=\"14\" filter=\"url(#shadow)\" /> <text x=\"520\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Architecture Communication Principles</text> <!-- Card 1 --> <g transform=\"translate(20, 38)\"> <rect width=\"490\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" /> <circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#2563eb\" /> <text x=\"24\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">1</text> <text x=\"44\" y=\"20\" class=\"txt-lbl\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Client Gateway</text> <text x=\"44\" y=\"36\" class=\"txt-sub\" fill=\"#475569\">External traffic hits Node.js CAP on $PORT. Node alone exposes HTTP.</text> </g> <!-- Card 2 --> <g transform=\"translate(530, 38)\"> <rect width=\"490\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" /> <circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#16a34a\" /> <text x=\"24\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">2</text> <text x=\"44\" y=\"20\" class=\"txt-lbl\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Zero-Latency IPC Bridge</text> <text x=\"44\" y=\"36\" class=\"txt-sub\" fill=\"#475569\">Node &amp; Python exchange JSON-RPC via stdin/stdout (0ms overhead).</text> </g> <!-- Card 3 --> <g transform=\"translate(20, 94)\"> <rect width=\"490\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" /> <circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#d97706\" /> <text x=\"24\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">3</text> <text x=\"44\" y=\"20\" class=\"txt-lbl\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">BTP Service Bindings</text> <text x=\"44\" y=\"36\" class=\"txt-sub\" fill=\"#475569\">Destination Service resolves target LLM URL &amp; credentials dynamically.</text> </g> <!-- Card 4 --> <g transform=\"translate(530, 94)\"> <rect width=\"490\" height=\"48\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" /> <circle cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#db2777\" /> <text x=\"24\" y=\"28\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">4</text> <text x=\"44\" y=\"20\" class=\"txt-lbl\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Isolated Execution</text> <text x=\"44\" y=\"36\" class=\"txt-sub\" fill=\"#475569\">Python process cannot be reached externally, ensuring full network isolation.</text> </g> </g></svg></div><p>The <strong>BookShop Multi-Buildpack</strong> application is an SAP BTP Cloud Foundry enterprise pattern built with SAP CAP (<code>@sap/cds</code>). It seamlessly combines a <strong>Node.js runtime</strong> (accepting OData V4 client requests) with a <strong>co-located Python process</strong> (handling ML discount calculations and LLM streaming inference).</p><h3>Component & Process Flow</h3><p>1. <strong>Client Request</strong>: Clients connect to the CAP OData V4 endpoints (<code>/browse</code> or <code>/ai</code>) or Fiori Elements UI.<br>2. <strong>Node.js CAP Server (<code>@sap/cds</code>)</strong>:<br>   - Handles entity persistence, OData V4 routing, and XSUAA authentication.<br>   - For special actions (<code>discount</code> or <code>ask</code>), Node.js delegates tasks to Python.<br>   - Resolves BTP Destinations (e.g. <code>destination-service</code> resolving <code>meta-llama-3-3-70b-instruct</code>) and passes connection credentials down to Python.<br>3. <strong>Python Worker Bridge (<code>python/functions.py --worker</code>)</strong>:<br>   - A single, persistent Python 3 process spawned lazily by <code>srv/python.js</code>.<br>   - Communicates with Node.js via newline-delimited JSON-RPC over <code>stdin</code>/<code>stdout</code> (paid once per container lifecycle, 0ms per-request cold start).<br>   - Performs discount math and OpenAI-compatible HTTP chat completion / SSE token streaming.<br>4. <strong>HANA Cloud / In-Memory DB</strong>: Serves persistent catalog data (<code>Book</code>, <code>Author</code>, <code>Order</code>).</p><h3>Component Responsibilities</h3><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table><thead><tr><th>Component</th><th>Technology</th><th>Responsibility</th><th>Communication</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Node.js CAP Server</strong></td><td>&lt;code&gt;@sap/cds&lt;/code&gt; v10 / Express</td><td>OData V4 API (&lt;code&gt;/browse&lt;/code&gt;), Fiori preview, Destination resolution, SSE streaming endpoint (&lt;code&gt;/ai/ask/stream&lt;/code&gt;)</td><td>&lt;code&gt;http&lt;/code&gt; on &lt;code&gt;$PORT&lt;/code&gt; (default 4004 / 8080)</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Python Worker</strong></td><td>Python 3 / &lt;code&gt;urllib&lt;/code&gt;</td><td>Discount keyword calculations, NVIDIA Llama 3.3 70B AI chat completions</td><td>&lt;code&gt;stdin&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;stdout&lt;/code&gt; JSON-RPC bridge</td></tr><tr><td><strong>BTP Services</strong></td><td>XSUAA, Destination, HDI</td><td>Auth JWT validation, Destination key lookup, HANA DB storage</td><td>SAP BTP Service Bindings</td></tr></tbody></table></div><br><h2>Security Boundaries</h2><div class=\"docs-diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1100 680\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\"> <defs> <linearGradient id=\"grad-public\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#fdf2f8\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#fce7f3\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"grad-gateway\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#eff6ff\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#dbeafe\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"grad-internal\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#f0fdf4\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#dcfce7\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"grad-backend\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#fff7ed\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#ffedd5\" /> </linearGradient> <filter id=\"shadow\" x=\"-8%\" y=\"-8%\" width=\"116%\" height=\"116%\"> <feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"4\" stdDeviation=\"6\" flood-color=\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08)\" /> </filter> <marker id=\"arr-blue\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#2563eb\" /> </marker> <marker id=\"arr-amber\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#d97706\" /> </marker> <marker id=\"arr-pink\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#db2777\" /> </marker> <style> .node-card { rx: 12; ry: 12; stroke-width: 1.5; filter: url(#shadow); } .txt-hdr { font-family: Ubuntu, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: #0f172a; } .txt-lbl { font-family: Ubuntu, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; fill: #334155; } .txt-sub { font-family: 'SF Mono', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 10px; fill: #64748b; } .flow-path { stroke-dasharray: 6,4; animation: dash 1.6s linear infinite; } @keyframes dash { to { stroke-dashoffset: -20; } } .chip { rx: 4; ry: 4; fill: #ffffff; stroke-width: 1; } .chip-txt { font-family: Ubuntu, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; } </style> </defs> <!-- Background --> <rect width=\"1100\" height=\"680\" fill=\"#ffffff\" rx=\"16\" /> <!-- Title --> <text x=\"550\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Security Boundaries &amp; Data Flow</text> <text x=\"550\" y=\"56\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#64748b\">Public Ingress Security • Process Isolation • Service Binding Encapsulation</text> <!-- Component Cards --> <!-- 1. Public Zone --> <g transform=\"translate(30, 85)\"> <rect width=\"230\" height=\"230\" fill=\"url(#grad-public)\" stroke=\"#f472b6\" class=\"node-card\" /> <text x=\"115\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#be185d\">1. Public Ingress Zone</text> <text x=\"115\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-lbl\">Cloud Foundry Router</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"70\" width=\"200\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#f472b6\" /> <text x=\"115\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">TLS 1.3 / HTTPS Termination</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"115\" width=\"200\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#f472b6\" /> <text x=\"115\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">DDoS / Web Firewall Filter</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"160\" width=\"200\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#f472b6\" /> <text x=\"115\" y=\"179\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">Port 443 -> Droplet $PORT</text> </g> <!-- 2. Gateway Zone (Node.js CAP) --> <g transform=\"translate(300, 85)\"> <rect width=\"240\" height=\"230\" fill=\"url(#grad-gateway)\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" class=\"node-card\" /> <text x=\"120\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\">2. Ingress Gateway (Node.js)</text> <text x=\"120\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-lbl\">Public Facing Process</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"70\" width=\"210\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" /> <text x=\"120\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">CORS Origin Whitelist</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"115\" width=\"210\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" /> <text x=\"120\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">XSUAA JWT Authorization</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"160\" width=\"210\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" /> <text x=\"120\" y=\"179\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">Rate Limiting (50 req/min)</text> </g> <!-- 3. Internal Isolation Zone (Python) --> <g transform=\"translate(580, 85)\"> <rect width=\"240\" height=\"230\" fill=\"url(#grad-internal)\" stroke=\"#86efac\" class=\"node-card\" /> <text x=\"120\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#15803d\">3. Isolated Python Worker</text> <text x=\"120\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-lbl\">Internal Only (No Port)</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"70\" width=\"210\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#86efac\" /> <text x=\"120\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">Zero Ingress Ports Opened</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"115\" width=\"210\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#86efac\" /> <text x=\"120\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">stdin / stdout Pipe Only</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"160\" width=\"210\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#86efac\" /> <text x=\"120\" y=\"179\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">Protected Math &amp; LLM Stream</text> </g> <!-- 4. Protected Backends --> <g transform=\"translate(860, 85)\"> <rect width=\"210\" height=\"230\" fill=\"url(#grad-backend)\" stroke=\"#fed7aa\" class=\"node-card\" /> <text x=\"105\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\" fill=\"#c2410c\">4. BTP Backends</text> <text x=\"105\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-lbl\">Service Credentials</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"70\" width=\"180\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#fdba74\" /> <text x=\"105\" y=\"89\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">SAP XSUAA Binding</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"115\" width=\"180\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#fdba74\" /> <text x=\"105\" y=\"134\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">Destination Auth Key</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"160\" width=\"180\" height=\"30\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#fdba74\" /> <text x=\"105\" y=\"179\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">HANA Cloud TLS</text> </g> <!-- Flow Connectors Top (Y=200) --> <path d=\"M 260,200 L 300,200\" stroke=\"#db2777\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"flow-path\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-pink)\" /> <path d=\"M 540,200 L 580,200\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"flow-path\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-blue)\" /> <path d=\"M 820,200 L 860,200\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"flow-path\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-amber)\" /> <!-- Security Audit Matrix Table (Bottom) --> <g transform=\"translate(30, 340)\"> <rect width=\"1040\" height=\"310\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" rx=\"14\" filter=\"url(#shadow)\" /> <rect width=\"1040\" height=\"42\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" rx=\"14\" /> <text x=\"520\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Security Controls &amp; Threat Mitigation Matrix</text> <!-- Header Row --> <text x=\"60\" y=\"65\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Boundary Layer</text> <text x=\"260\" y=\"65\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Primary Defense Mechanism</text> <text x=\"580\" y=\"65\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Mitigated Risk / Vulnerability</text> <text x=\"880\" y=\"65\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Enforcement Point</text> <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"75\" x2=\"1000\" y2=\"75\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" stroke-width=\"1\" /> <!-- Row 1 --> <text x=\"60\" y=\"105\" class=\"txt-lbl\" font-weight=\"700\">Public Ingress</text> <text x=\"260\" y=\"105\" class=\"txt-sub\">TLS 1.3 Encryption + CF Route Service</text> <text x=\"580\" y=\"105\" class=\"txt-sub\">Man-in-the-Middle (MITM) &amp; Eavesdropping</text> <text x=\"880\" y=\"105\" class=\"txt-sub\">Cloud Foundry Gorouter</text> <!-- Row 2 --> <text x=\"60\" y=\"145\" class=\"txt-lbl\" font-weight=\"700\">Node.js Gateway</text> <text x=\"260\" y=\"145\" class=\"txt-sub\">XSUAA JWT Validation + Express CORS</text> <text x=\"580\" y=\"145\" class=\"txt-sub\">Unauthorized Access &amp; CSRF Attacks</text> <text x=\"880\" y=\"145\" class=\"txt-sub\">srv/server.js Middleware</text> <!-- Row 3 --> <text x=\"60\" y=\"185\" class=\"txt-lbl\" font-weight=\"700\">Rate Control</text> <text x=\"260\" y=\"185\" class=\"txt-sub\">Token Bucket (50 req/min per user)</text> <text x=\"580\" y=\"185\" class=\"txt-sub\">Denial of Service (DoS) &amp; API Abuse</text> <text x=\"880\" y=\"185\" class=\"txt-sub\">express-rate-limit</text> <!-- Row 4 --> <text x=\"60\" y=\"225\" class=\"txt-lbl\" font-weight=\"700\">Python Worker</text> <text x=\"260\" y=\"225\" class=\"txt-sub\">No network sockets; stdin/stdout IPC</text> <text x=\"580\" y=\"225\" class=\"txt-sub\">Direct External Exploitation &amp; Port Scan</text> <text x=\"880\" y=\"225\" class=\"txt-sub\">srv/python.js Subprocess</text> <!-- Row 5 --> <text x=\"60\" y=\"265\" class=\"txt-lbl\" font-weight=\"700\">AI Core Outbound</text> <text x=\"260\" y=\"265\" class=\"txt-sub\">Dynamic BTP Destination Service Credentials</text> <text x=\"580\" y=\"265\" class=\"txt-sub\">Hardcoded API Key Leakage in Repos</text> <text x=\"880\" y=\"265\" class=\"txt-sub\">BTP Destination Binding</text> </g></svg></div><ul><li><strong>Authentication</strong>: User authentication is enforced via SAP BTP XSUAA JWT validation.</li><br><li><strong>Service Isolation</strong>: The Python process is co-located in the container and isolated from external networks; only the Node.js CAP server exposes external HTTP ports.</li><br><li><strong>Destination Security</strong>: Outbound AI Core and external API credentials are managed securely through SAP BTP Destination Service.</li><br></ul>","tags":["architecture"],"details":""}